8844", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036696_194179613772177_1573978079084844927_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8yCgp3sOvrQQ7kNvwEOCp_a&_nc_oc=AdmQufMuFmTBYUEY4O46L1p5UPwkwLLPKfwvPD6F07jmEdQEv0mZscGISaCdW0-bhJk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftngkfv971W4kr6kIC4a13_p0hBBLwUQWuHY57ZU5cFCQ&oe=69A2FC9E"}, {"file_name": "movesapiensdrone.png", "id": "764669845469577", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984445_764669848802910_7366831044223632089_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0Hqj2VLLlmIQ7kNvwHvI0T4&_nc_oc=AdnQq1Ct_vet970BHQuUFuOg9nve_dsUxp_HzaHyG-G_cTlBmcrRk1Lgy2wFG29arrI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuC4fGAzCBwBNVXq9Gg5AWuo-E9bGmT9FePZn4UalRKRw&oe=69A2D80B"}, {"file_name": "movesapiensready.png", "id": "337520715646442", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982478_337520718979775_5518724192048290935_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0hEvSnv8Qp8Q7kNvwGxnWCl&_nc_oc=AdlAUdCZFeQ9msNHF09mnmU8SHF7F9fDC31BcYq2mwqJ3yK1VvjC7jj0NXFprxxQ2GU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvp7gEAs8OJAYo75pumNd5HlwCCzZewV1O-7nK9oGmxnA&oe=69A2F235"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "movesapiensbattle.png", "id": "369502332406406", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974567_369502335739739_4753847007498255395_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7Q-soreDaX0Q7kNvwHSXnLM&_nc_oc=Adl3wQZBp8hMvZlMT3hqAYk0RNSPNul4o0yKW6UZ1bPaFyPhjVcpx1p71jNY3bdQ5Ik&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuXFRaoXWV4aqyjcFOxMF7VkMuSL4rd5FabqHkB3kEOGg&oe=69A2DC92"}, "display_name": "Move Sapiens Ltda", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Dive into the year 2107 with \"Move Sapiens Exoskeleton VR,\" an Oculus App Lab sensation blending HIIT (High-Intensity Interval Training) and virtual reality gaming. As a symbol of constant evolution and scientific validation within sports science, this game is more than just an experience\u2014it's a revolution.\n\nYou'll be greeted by S.A.I.H.A., your Symbiont Artificial Intelligence for Human Augmentation, integrated into the groundbreaking Move Sapiens Exoskeleton. In a dystopian world dominated by omnipotent corporations, your mission is clear: evolve, adapt, and dismantle the tyrannical forces. Train rigorously against a reprogrammed drone, enhancing your physical and cognitive abilities symbiotically.\n\nOur game boasts a unique Kinetic Energy Optimization System, allowing you to absorb and manipulate energy, granting unprecedented powers. The training comprises 12 blocks of intense 16-second HIIT boxing sessions, with 20 seconds for kinetic energy reloading. Every punch counts, monitored for speed and strength.\n\nAs you master kinetic manipulation, S.A.I.H.A. offers real-time data processing and strategic insights, optimizing every move towards liberation. The game is an immersive journey, a synergy of biology and technology, pushing you beyond human constraints. Be part of the vanguard, embody the nexus of human spirit and artificial intelligence, and forge a new era of freedom and justice.\n\nJoin us in \"Move Sapiens Exoskeleton VR\" \u2013 where gaming meets evolution, and every move", "short_description": "\"Move Sapiens Exoskeleton VR\" is an Oculus App Lab game set in 2107, where players train in a dystopian world using the Move Sapiens Exoskeleton and AI S.A.I.H.A. The game combines HIIT with VR, focusing on physical and cognitive enhancement through rigorous training. It features a unique Kinetic Energy Optimization System for absorbing and manipulating energy, with gameplay involving intense HIIT boxing sessions. The game aims to push players beyond human limits, blending technology and biology"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://movesapiens.my.canva.site/politica-de-privacidade", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null